== network flag: warden build --driver container --network warden-x $CTX
  error: unknown flag --network for driver "container"
  fix:   see 'warden build --driver container --help' for the flags this driver takes
== [Runtime] cli: warden build --driver container $CTX
warden.toml:
    [Runtime]
    cli = "podman"
  error: $CTX/warden.toml: [Runtime] cli: keys are case-sensitive, and the container driver reads [driver.container] cli (old name [runtime] cli)
  fix:   write it as [driver.container] cli
== [runtime] Relay_Image: warden build --driver container $CTX
warden.toml:
    [runtime]
    Relay_Image = "dev"
  error: $CTX/warden.toml: [runtime] Relay_Image: keys are case-sensitive, and the container driver reads [driver.container] relay_image (old name [runtime] relay_image)
  fix:   write it as [driver.container] relay_image
